# 🎤 OPIc Question - Day29

## Question

What is an activity you enjoy doing in your free time?
Why do you enjoy it?

---

## Speaking Mission

Speak for 60–90 seconds.

Include:

- What the activity is
- When you usually do it
- Why you enjoy it
- A specific example
- Another reason
- Your conclusion

---

## Challenge

Use today's expression:

> The main reason is that...

Also try to use:

> For example,...

> Another reason is that...

> That's why...

---

## Recommended Structure

I enjoy...

↓

The main reason is that...

↓

For example,...

↓

Another reason is that...

↓

That's why...
